[E0452] Error: a struct is taken apart without its name
    ╭─[ err/450_struct_patterns_without_a_name/main.wip:15:9 ]
    │
 15 │     val Point(x, y) = here
    │         ──┬──
    │           ╰──── the struct's name
    │
    │ Help: drop the name
    │
    │ Note: a struct has one shape, so its name tests nothing: `(x, y)` takes it apart by its fields' names
────╯
