[E0313] Error: a tuple's elements have no names
    ╭─[ err/450_struct_patterns_without_a_name/main.wip:18:10 ]
    │
 18 │     val (first: one, second) = (1, 2)
    │          ──┬──
    │            ╰──── a name before `:`
    │
    │ Note: a tuple is taken apart by position, `(first, second)`; a struct by its fields' names, `(x: across, ..)`
────╯
