    │
 19 │     val (s, ..) = (1, 2)
    │         ───┬───
    │            ╰───── `..` in a tuple's pattern
    │
    │ Note: a tuple is taken apart by position, `(first, second)`; a struct by its fields' names, `(x: across, ..)`
────╯
