[E0313] Error: a pattern in parentheses takes apart a tuple or a struct, and this is `i64`
    ╭─[ err/450_struct_patterns_without_a_name/main.wip:21:9 ]
    │
 21 │     val (n) = 5
    │         ─┬─
    │          ╰─── not a tuple or a struct
    │
